## Week 4 - Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)

### Topics Covered
- Introduction to Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)
- EBS Volume Types
- Creating and Attaching EBS Volumes
- Formatting and Mounting EBS Volumes
- Resizing EBS Volumes
- Creating and Managing EBS Snapshots

### Hands-on Practice
- Created an EBS volume.
- Attached the volume to an EC2 instance.
- Formatted and mounted the volume.
- Verified persistent storage.
- Created an EBS snapshot.

### Skills Gained
- Learned how to manage persistent block storage for EC2.
- Attached and mounted EBS volumes to EC2 instances.
- Performed volume backup using snapshots.
- Understood EBS volume management and storage concepts.
